      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MONUMENT (5) was prominent throughout when winning two back but could manage only midfield last time when 5th and beaten 7 lengths at Sandown (29.92). Can atone. OPAWA VICTORIA (3) steps out for the first time at this track. Comes here a winner at Addington last time in a SPECA FIN (30.36). Should be in this for a long way. PAW NIALL (7) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (34.75) at Sandown behind Lush Hour in a Grade 5. Settled off speed and worked to the line nicely. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Hard to beat again. ASTON POLICY (1) was unplaced here last start but gets her chance to atone.",
